Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.41,0:01:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好怀念
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.48,0:01:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这个交换日记持续了多久
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.50,0:01:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,姊姊的回复 让人好期待
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.01,0:01:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,(绘图日记)\N画得真好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.55,0:01:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,来画今天的份吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.51,0:01:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,就画来到海边了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.76,0:01:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗 光留
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.68,0:01:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,姊姊在笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.13,0:01:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,所以这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:02:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,所以这是…梦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.63,0:02:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,(绘画比赛奖状)\N(第二名 松来光留)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,(Inhuman)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.70,0:02:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,(1.无人性的 像怪物般)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.40,0:02:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,(2.没有人情味)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.10,0:02:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,(3.冷酷的 残酷的)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.20,0:03:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,《异人酒店》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.24,0:04:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,(ParL Mart 8)\N(甜点祭)\N(委托20 机车日记1)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢惠顾
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.83,0:04:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,烟又涨价了?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.35,0:04:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,物价到底怎么了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.65,0:04:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,能不能饶了我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.48,0:04:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,请给我27号
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.57,0:04:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,(杀手侦探)\N(店员推荐 角色抽奖)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.98,0:04:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,还有抽一次这个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.51,0:04:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.14,0:04:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,(角色抽奖)\N是这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,(角色抽奖)\N给您
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.92,0:04:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧 我忘记带钱包了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.97,0:04:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我的全部财产 只有这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.03,0:05:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,该选哪一个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.07,0:05:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.46,0:05:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,您很喜欢杀手侦探吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.27,0:05:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,并没有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.34,0:05:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,(杀手侦探)\N(店员推荐 角色抽奖)\N因为广告牌很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.59,0:05:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我对可爱的东西没什么抵抗力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.90,0:05:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.71,0:05:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还是不要烟了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.19,0:05:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,请给我这…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.94,0:05:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,给您
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不是给您的 是借您的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.81,0:05:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那个广告牌是我画的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,算是我的责任吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就不客气了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.14,0:05:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,(恭喜中奖 SS奖)\N(请至店面兑换奖品)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.87,0:05:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,SS奖
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.80,0:05:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,(SS奖玩偶)\NSS奖
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.24,0:05:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.67,0:05:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,超可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.14,0:05:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.47,0:05:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.13,0:05:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,(松来)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.35,0:06:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,松来小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.12,0:06:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我超开心的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.24,0:06:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.93,0:06:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,总之我现在得想办法回报妳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,您现在不是没钱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.55,0:06:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,作为交换…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.44,0:06:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 她还不懂事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.64,0:06:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,还没买怎么可以拆开
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.77,0:06:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的很抱歉\N- 不然这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.10,0:06:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这个我来买吧 刚好有找钱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那个…\N- 没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.55,0:06:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,以后尽可能牵着她的手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,牵我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.93,0:06:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.51,0:07:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.38,0:07:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前也是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.98,0:07:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,姊姊为了不让我走散
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.40,0:07:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,总是紧紧牵住我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.73,0:07:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢您
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.54,0:07:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我完全没注意到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.15,0:07:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,松来小姐妳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.61,0:07:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不要那么轻易借钱给别人比较好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.24,0:07:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,大家不见得跟我一样都是好人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.03,0:07:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.90,0:07:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,很可爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.37,0:07:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.21,0:07:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.04,0:07:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.39,0:08:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.22,0:08:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.83,0:08:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这个500圆
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.97,0:08:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,在全部抽完之前 先借我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.44,0:08:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,可以是可以 为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.19,0:08:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,求个好彩头
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.80,0:08:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A奖
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.65,0:08:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,(A奖玩偶)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.86,0:08:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜您
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.50,0:08:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了 好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,妳今天下班了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.02,0:08:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.22,0:08:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我送妳回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.46,0:08:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么可能坐\N连名字都不知道的人的机车啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.47,0:08:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,桐原柴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.15,0:09:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,身边的人都叫我小柴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.99,0:09:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,小柴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.52,0:09:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,妳是松来?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.09,0:09:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.51,0:09:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.81,0:09:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,(恭喜中奖 D奖)\N(请至店面兑换奖品)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.78,0:09:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,D奖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.79,0:09:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,(D奖玩偶)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.09,0:09:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜您
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.38,0:09:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,松来小姐 这个可爱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.85,0:09:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就当作很可爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.81,0:09:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,光留
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.53,0:09:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫松来光留
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.52,0:09:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,光留是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.22,0:09:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,妳也有这种东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.42,0:10:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,(ParL Mart 8)\N(甜点祭)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.11,0:10:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,烟灰缸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是常识吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.48,0:10:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,妳是做什么工作的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.50,0:10:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我在酒店工作 负责接待客人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.56,0:10:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,真意外
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.49,0:10:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没想到妳是上班族
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.03,0:10:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.41,0:10:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,因为妳不分昼夜都会来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.99,0:10:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,因为是排班制的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.03,0:10:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有早班也有晚班嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.93,0:10:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,跟超商没什么两样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.83,0:10:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,妳从以前就很会画画吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.70,0:10:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道以前怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.00,0:10:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不过姊姊常常夸奖我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.39,0:10:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那就代表很厉害吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.73,0:10:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,松来小姐 请来收银
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.30,0:10:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.83,0:11:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.39,0:11:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,(杀手侦探)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.77,0:11:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.18,0:11:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,前阵子只有这些吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.44,0:11:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么每天都在增加
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.34,0:11:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,妳还是一样 很喜欢可爱的东西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.90,0:11:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,妳还记得啊 不愧是沙罗前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.88,0:11:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 生朗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.72,0:11:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是叫你别碰吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.19,0:11:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,小柴小姐 这是在哪里买的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.92,0:11:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这是在我喜欢的一家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.83,0:11:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,广告牌很可爱的超商
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.82,0:11:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,(美味肉包)\N抱歉 我接个电话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.93,0:11:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.39,0:12:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,(无生命迹象)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.61,0:12:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,(绘图日记)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.89,0:12:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,《异人酒店》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.47,0:12:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.30,0:12:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,(ParL Mart 8)\N(甜点祭)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.49,0:12:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,(美味肉包)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.84,0:13:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.71,0:13:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 小柴?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.61,0:13:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,妳又来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.41,0:13:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,抽奖明明已经全部结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.67,0:13:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,因为全部结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.28,0:13:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我想把跟妳借的钱还给妳
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.11,0:13:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.78,0:13:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我也全部结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.33,0:13:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我去火葬了姊姊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.51,0:13:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,妳看 我穿着丧服
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.82,0:13:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,很难接话吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.59,0:13:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我自己先剧透
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.07,0:13:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.94,0:14:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就知道她活不久了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.36,0:14:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,一直都在做准备
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.80,0:14:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但火葬结束 回到家后
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.69,0:14:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉很空虚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.26,0:14:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,因为她常常反复住院出院
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.47,0:14:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,像是住院时的换洗衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.63,0:14:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,还有吃药管理等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.83,0:14:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,当我不用再做任何一件事后
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.20,0:14:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,就不知道该如何是好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.96,0:14:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才想去打工活动一下身体
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.09,0:14:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,(有一则新讯息)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.93,0:14:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,(绘图日记)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.21,0:14:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,小柴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.61,0:14:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才的钱 不用还了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.14,0:14:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,作为交换 我有一个请求
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.78,0:15:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,去海边
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.65,0:15:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,海边?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.79,0:15:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,带我去海边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.26,0:15:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,要出发啰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.91,0:15:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么是海
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.29,0:15:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 听不见
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.78,0:16:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么是海啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.78,0:16:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,风好凉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.58,0:16:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,妳有在听我说话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.48,0:16:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,绘图日记
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.31,0:16:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,听不见
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.06,0:16:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,绘图日记
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.66,0:16:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,小时候 我和姊姊一起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.17,0:16:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,写过绘图交换日记
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.33,0:16:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,结果在去海边的那一天结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.66,0:16:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我想想起为什么在那里结束
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.93,0:16:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好险
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.33,0:16:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.42,0:16:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才想去海边啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.78,0:16:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,因为绘图日记的事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.76,0:16:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,已经无法问本人了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.42,0:16:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,也是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.82,0:16:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,话说回来 妳居然会答应
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.96,0:16:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,在这种深夜里 还是去海边
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.60,0:16:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,一般来说 都会拒绝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.61,0:17:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是在还人情罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.51,0:17:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,话说妳自己也知道这不正常啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.48,0:17:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.78,0:17:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,(杀手侦探)\N(店员推荐 角色抽奖)\N因为广告牌很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.18,0:17:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我对可爱的东西没什么抵抗力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.42,0:17:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.51,0:17:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.91,0:17:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,从现在开始 我要说的事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.73,0:17:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,请不要听
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.92,0:17:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 完全听不见
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.68,0:17:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我的姊姊叫满留
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.76,0:17:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,她非常擅长画画
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.82,0:17:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.53,0:17:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,姊姊 姊姊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.64,0:17:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,妳看 我拿到了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.43,0:17:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,绘画比赛第二名
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.27,0:18:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.81,0:18:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不过还是输给姊姊的第一名了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.78,0:18:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是说过画画没有分输赢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.73,0:18:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,拿第一名的人说这种话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.74,0:18:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,只是在挖苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.64,0:18:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.78,0:18:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我最喜欢妳画的画了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.43,0:18:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,以后也要多画画喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.83,0:18:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,(鬼灯之诗)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.24,0:18:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,(封面·插画 松来满留)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要加油
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.80,0:18:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,姊姊 电话响啰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.60,0:18:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,姊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.18,0:19:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,长的话两年 短的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.46,0:19:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,从那个夏天开始
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.19,0:19:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,姊姊就不断往返家里和医院
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.12,0:19:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,积蓄慢慢减少
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我开始打工
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.61,0:19:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,学校 打工 照顾病人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.27,0:19:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,学校 打工 照顾病人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.21,0:19:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,在那之间 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.44,0:20:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,今年开始 姊姊的病情恶化了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.03,0:20:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.00,0:20:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这大概是最后一次回来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.86,0:21:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,小柴 谢谢妳当作没听到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.62,0:21:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,妳在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.19,0:21:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我请妳喝咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.90,0:21:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,沙罗前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.49,0:21:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢妳代替我值晚班
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.27,0:21:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托妳啰 小柴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.04,0:22:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,(机车日记 下集待续)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.03,0:23:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,(下集 委托21 机车日记2)

